{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-services","type":"group","x":1360,"y":-100,"width":2180,"height":1260,"color":"4","label":"Services"},
		{"id":"group-data","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1520,"width":3640,"height":420,"color":"3","label":"Data Layer"},
		{"id":"group-orchestration","type":"group","x":-100,"y":680,"width":1120,"height":480,"color":"5","label":"Orchestration"},
		{"id":"group-clients","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-100,"width":1120,"height":440,"color":"6","label":"Clients"},
		{"id":"note-rules","type":"text","text":"# Rules\n\n- One owner per store\n- Temporal orchestrates every write\n- One door per entity, version-checked saves\n- Events are thin notices, sent only by the outbox\n- Consumers read the current state back over gRPC\n- No JSONB; every field is a column or a table","x":-760,"y":-100,"width":440,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"documents","type":"text","text":"# Documents\n\n- [[docs/architecture/Architecture Index|Architecture Index]]\n- [[docs/architecture/update_service|Update Service]]\n- [[docs/architecture/ingestion_pipeline|Ingestion Pipeline]]\n- [[docs/architecture/postgres_integration_architecture_decision|PostgreSQL Service]]\n- [[docs/architecture/Database Schema|Database Schema]]\n- [[docs/architecture/event_driven_architecture|Event-Driven Architecture]]\n- [[docs/architecture/event_schema_specification|Event Schema Specification]]\n- [[docs/architecture/echora_contracts|Schema Ownership & Contracts]]\n- [[docs/architecture/temporal_infrastructure|Temporal Infrastructure]]\n- [[docs/architecture/frontend_plan|Frontend & Backend Discovery Plan]]","x":-760,"y":300,"width":440,"height":460,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"providers","type":"text","text":"# External Providers\n\nMAL, AniList, Kitsu, AniDB, Anime-Planet, AniSearch, AnimeSchedule\n(HTTP / CDP)","x":3000,"y":-440,"width":420,"height":180},
		{"id":"frontend","type":"text","text":"# Frontend\n\n**Status**: Planned\n**Talks to**: Backend only","x":-40,"y":-20,"width":320,"height":170},
		{"id":"reviewer","type":"text","text":"# Reviewer\n\nHuman reviewer (local HTTP now, multi-user later)","x":-40,"y":200,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"backend","type":"text","text":"# Backend\n\n**Tech**: Rust (`axum`, `async-graphql`, `tonic`)\n**Status**: Planned\n**Role**: The frontend's single entry point\n**API**: GraphQL\n**Starts**: refresh on open (Temporal client)","x":560,"y":-20,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"temporal","type":"text","text":"# Temporal Server\n\n**Version**: 1.31+\n**Databases**: `temporal`, `temporal_visibility`\n**Namespace**: `echora`\n**Keeps**: every run's history, episode timers","x":-40,"y":760,"width":340,"height":240},
		{"id":"update","type":"text","text":"# Update Service\n\n**Tech**: Rust, Temporal Rust SDK\n**Workflows**: refresh per work, episode and character; sweep; episode tracking; synopsis; seed load\n**Calls**: Enrichment, Agent and PostgreSQL over gRPC","x":560,"y":760,"width":400,"height":320},
		{"id":"users","type":"text","text":"# Users Service\n\n**Status**: Planned\n**Role**: accounts, MAL and AniList logins, lists\n**Store**: its own database","x":1440,"y":-20,"width":380,"height":220},
		{"id":"notify","type":"text","text":"# Notification Service\n\n**Status**: Planned\n**Reads**: NOTIFICATION_EVENTS","x":3020,"y":780,"width":380,"height":200},
		{"id":"pgservice","type":"text","text":"# PostgreSQL Service\n\n**Tech**: Rust, sqlx, tonic\n**Status**: Planned\n**Role**: the database's only owner; never calls other services; version-checked saves\n**Publishes**: outbox → NATS","x":-40,"y":1600,"width":380,"height":280},
		{"id":"pgdb","type":"text","text":"# PostgreSQL 18\n\n**Tables**: provider pages and responses, works, episodes, characters and every model field (no JSONB), corrections, AI text, approval queue, outbox","x":560,"y":1600,"width":380,"height":300},
		{"id":"nats","type":"text","text":"# NATS JetStream 2.15\n\n**ANIME_EVENTS**: `created` · `updated` · `deleted` for anime, episode and character\n**NOTIFICATION_EVENTS**: episode aired, status changed\n**ANIME_DLQ**: dead letters","x":1440,"y":1600,"width":420,"height":280},
		{"id":"qdrant","type":"text","text":"# Qdrant\n\n**Collection**: `anime_database`\n**Vectors**: text 1024 (dense + sparse), image 768\n**Owner**: Vector Service","x":2220,"y":1600,"width":380,"height":240},
		{"id":"agent","type":"text","text":"# Agent Service\n\n**Tech**: Python\n**Status**: Planned\n**Role**: every AI call: synopses, character attributes, Jev review scoring, search reasoning","x":3020,"y":400,"width":380,"height":260},
		{"id":"redis","type":"text","text":"# Redis\n\n**Role**: HTTP cache (Enrichment) and entity/response cache (Backend)","x":3120,"y":1660,"width":380,"height":240},
		{"id":"vector","type":"text","text":"# Vector Service\n\n**Tech**: Python, BGE-M3 + OpenCLIP\n**Status**: Built; event consumers planned\n**Role**: search; indexes works, episodes and characters from events","x":2160,"y":-55,"width":380,"height":240},
		{"id":"enrichment","type":"text","text":"# Enrichment Service\n\n**Tech**: Python, `libs/enrichment`\n**Status**: Built; FetchPage and merge methods planned\n**Role**: fetch pages; map and merge works, episodes and characters","x":3020,"y":30,"width":380,"height":240},
		{"id":"review","type":"text","text":"# Review Page\n\n**Tech**: Python, FastAPI + htmx\n**Status**: Built, local\n**Later**: multi-user approval queue on PostgreSQL","x":1360,"y":800,"width":380,"height":240}
	],
